#: templates/content/home.html:5
msgid ""
"Virtual machines, GPU servers and storage in data centers in Kazakhstan, "
"with your data kept in the country. Choose the resources you need, connect "
"over the internet, the corporate network or a dedicated L2 channel, and "
"manage everything in the OpenNebula console."
