#: templates/tenants/_connectivity.html:70
msgid ""
"Bridges one of the project's subnets to an external VLAN, or to another of "
"the project's subnets on a different site. The first is approved by a "
"resource manager (support sets the VLAN); the second needs no approval and "
"spans two resource pools on two sites."
msgstr ""
