msgid "What runs on the platform's machines. When a machine is deployed, the deployment looks at what is installed on it and takes every service whose checks match (Present when); nothing is assigned by hand. Each service found gives its rsyslog and logrotate files: its log sources sent to the site's log collector with its log_type, and their local rotation. A service with no log sources goes with the common sources (Logging rules)."
